<title>USA: Key IMM currency futures begin lower.</title>
<headline>Key IMM currency futures begin lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 22 - Key IMM currency futures started lower amid followthrough from overnight dollar gains. Sept marks and Swiss at new contract lows amid ideas EMU to be broadbased, soft. Sept yen below $0.008700 support. Market also looking ahead to Greenspan's Humphrey-Hawkins testimony, at 1300 CDT/1800 GMT.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
